tyDirectTouch(_:options:)","type":"topic"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"abstract":[{"text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"title":"Swami","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami"}}}